    rdfs:label "OGC Application Package" ;
    dct:abstract "Conformance class for OGC API — Processes Part 2 (DRAFT). Defines the schema of an OGC Application Package document — a formal process description used to dynamically deploy or replace a process — and the media type (application/ogcapppkg+json) used to carry it in requests and responses."^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
